---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<BaseLayout title="Home" description="Multi-agent orchestration MCP server">
  <section class="section hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <p class="label">Multi-Agent Orchestration</p>
      <h1 class="display-large">
        Coordinate AI experts with
        <span class="accent">research-backed protocols</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="subtitle">
        One MCP server to route tasks to Claude, Gemini, Codex, and OpenCode.
        Byzantine fault tolerance, intelligent routing, and 8 memory systems.
      </p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a href="/nexus-agents/docs/getting-started/installation/" class="btn-primary">
          Get Started &rarr;
        </a>
        <a href="https://github.com/williamzujkowski/nexus-agents" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-outline">
          View on GitHub &nearr;
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="headline-large">How It Works</h2>
    <p class="subtitle section-subtitle">
      Tasks are analyzed, routed to the best available model, and validated through consensus when agents disagree.
    </p>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h3 class="title-large">10 Expert Agents</h3>
        <p class="card-text">Code, Architecture, Security, Documentation, Testing, DevOps, Research, PM, UX/UI, and Infrastructure experts with domain-specific knowledge.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3 class="title-large">Consensus Protocols</h3>
        <p class="card-text">Aegean BFT and CPABFT for multi-agent agreement. 6 voting strategies resolve conflicts. Validated at 85.7% fault tolerance.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3 class="title-large">Intelligent Routing</h3>
        <p class="card-text">LinUCB contextual bandits learn which model works best per task. TOPSIS multi-criteria scoring with adaptive timeouts.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3 class="title-large">8 Memory Systems</h3>
        <p class="card-text">Graph, session, typed, belief, and adaptive memory backends. MIRIX six-type architecture for cross-session learning.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3 class="title-large">25 MCP Tools</h3>
        <p class="card-text">Orchestration, expert creation, workflow execution, consensus voting, research tracking, and repository analysis via MCP.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3 class="title-large">Research-Backed</h3>
        <p class="card-text">174+ papers tracked. 47 technique-to-implementation mappings. arXiv integration for continuous discovery.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="headline-large">Quick Start</h2>
    <p class="subtitle">Install and connect to Claude Desktop in under 5 minutes.</p>
    <div class="code-grid">
      <div>
        <h3 class="title-large code-step">1. Install</h3>
        <pre class="code-block"><code># Install globally
pnpm install -g nexus-agents

# Verify
nexus-agents doctor</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="title-large code-step">2. Connect to Claude</h3>
        <pre class="code-block"><code># ~/.claude/mcp.json
{'{'}
  "mcpServers": {'{'}
    "nexus-agents": {'{'}
      "command": "nexus-agents",
      "args": ["--mode=server"]
    {'}'}
  {'}'}
{'}'}</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="headline-large">Architecture</h2>
    <pre class="code-block"><code>MCP Protocol (25 tools, rate-limited, auth)
    |
Orchestrator (task analysis, expert delegation)
    |
+--------+--------+--------+----------+
| Claude | Gemini | Codex  | OpenCode |
+--------+--------+--------+----------+
    |
Composite Router
  Budget &rarr; Zero &rarr; Preference &rarr; TOPSIS &rarr; LinUCB
    |
+----------+--------+-----------+----------+
| Consensus| Memory | Workflows | Security |
+----------+--------+-----------+----------+</code></pre>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="headline-large">Documentation</h2>
    <div class="card-grid cols-4">
      <a href="/nexus-agents/docs/getting-started/installation/" class="card link-card">
        <h3 class="title-large">Getting Started</h3>
        <p class="card-text">Installation, configuration, first orchestration.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/nexus-agents/docs/guides/mcp_integration/" class="card link-card">
        <h3 class="title-large">MCP Integration</h3>
        <p class="card-text">Connect nexus-agents to Claude Desktop and other MCP clients.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/nexus-agents/docs/guides/workflow_templates/" class="card link-card">
        <h3 class="title-large">Workflows</h3>
        <p class="card-text">Built-in workflow templates for common tasks.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/nexus-agents/docs/research/research_index/" class="card link-card">
        <h3 class="title-large">Research</h3>
        <p class="card-text">Papers and techniques backing the protocols.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .section {
    max-width: 72rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
  }
  .hero {
    padding-top: 5rem;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
  }
  .hero-content {
    max-width: 48rem;
  }

  .label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .display-large {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .accent { color: var(--color-primary); }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .section-subtitle {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .headline-large {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .title-large {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .btn-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: var(--color-on-primary);
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: box-shadow 200ms;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { box-shadow: 0 4px 12px oklch(0 0 0 / 0.15); }

  .btn-outline {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-outline-variant);
    color: var(--color-on-surface);
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 200ms, color 200ms;
  }
  .btn-outline:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-primary);
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .card-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
  }
  .card-grid.cols-4 {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr));
  }

  .card {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-outline-variant);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--color-surface-container);
    transition: border-color 200ms, box-shadow 200ms;
  }
  .card:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-primary);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px oklch(0 0 0 / 0.08);
  }

  .card-text {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.625;
    color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);
  }

  .link-card {
    text-decoration: none;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .link-card h3 {
    color: var(--color-on-surface);
    transition: color 200ms;
  }
  .link-card:hover h3 { color: var(--color-primary); }

  .code-step {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .code-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .code-block {
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    background: var(--color-inverse-surface);
    color: var(--color-inverse-on-surface);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
    line-height: 1.625;
  }
</style>
